      <name>Intelligence Summary</name>
      <Placemark>
        <name>AI Council Assessment</name>
        <styleUrl>#intel</styleUrl>
        <description>The Department of War has been actively advancing its technological capabilities, discussing critical material recovery possibilities, and enhancing secure collaboration in classified defense work. The Department of War has also been conducting operational exercises, including a first-of-its-kind flight powered by Army-made motors, and testing Marine Corps installation partnerships. The Department of War has been working on breaking down barriers to classified defense work and strengthening the defense industrial base.</description>
        <Point>
          <coordinates>0,0,0</coordinates>
        </Point>
      </Placemark>
